LAKEFLOW CONNECT:
======================

Earlier organizations had to use lot of 3rd party tools for ingestion into lakehouse.
With Lakeflow connect we can have efficient ingestion pipelines all within databricks.

* Standard Connectors ->  ingest from cloud storage (ALDS , S3 , volumes)
* Managed Connectors ->  ingest from SAAS applications and databases.

- Batch load
- Incremental batch load
- Incremental streaming


Data Ingestion from cloud storage:
1) CTAS
2) Copy into
3) Auto loader


